    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="58.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 58.2</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="58.2" corresp="#wit-g-a">Gif hwa leodbisceopes oððe ealdormannes borh abrece, gebete þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> mid II pundan.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="58.2" corresp="#wit-a">Gif hwa leodbiscopes oððe ealdormannes burg abrece, gebete þæt mid twam pundum.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="58.2" corresp="#wit-q">Si quis episcopi uel aldremanni (id est comitis) plegium frangat, II lib. emendet.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="58.2" corresp="#wit-b">Gyf hwa leodbisceopes oððe ealdormannes borh abrece, gebete mid twam pundum.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-g-a">Gif hwa leodbisceopes oððe ealdormannes borh abrece, gebete þæt mid II pundan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">If anyone violates the protection of the bishop of a diocese or of an ealdorman, he shall pay £2 as compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-g-a">If anyone violates the protection of a diocesan bishop or an ealdorman, he shall be penalized two pounds.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock">If anyone violates a diocesan bishop’s or an ealdorman’s surety, he is to compensate for it with two pounds.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Wenn einer eines Diöcesanbischofs oder eines Ealdorman Schutzgewähr (Burg A) verletzt, büsse er das [diesem] mit 2 Pfund.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">If anyone violates the protection (stronghold, A) of a diocesan bishop or of an ealdorman, let him atone for it [to him] with 2 pounds.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="350"><ref target="clause:Af_3">Af 3</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">ebd.</note>
        <note type="comparison" source="#whitelock" n="470"><label>from</label> <ref target="clause:Af_3">Af 3</ref> <quote>from Alfred 3</quote></note>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann thinks A's ‘burg’ is perhaps only a scribal error for ‘borh’.</note>
        <note type="translator" source="#whitelock">from Alfred 3</note>
        <note type="textual" source="#rabin-doml">borh: burg A</note>
        <note type="textual" source="#rabin-doml">þæt: omitted B</note>
      </div>
    </body>
